{"candidate_identity":"d3fbdca2176baaee9af62c36372f8d1dc593fda8412baa55b1d6fa3e83f2d24d","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d48559306881d128a88dc23aeed1f654ec8c73e68018629afb25493fb4b2987a","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"dcfd031f93528025ae4e20dcce875805317ed94d02a1b64c3c7c696ed6b2eeca","logical_entry_identity":"04148d1d1a070fdbfa010ad51ce1873b453966c66578913af72e136b0f71eb02","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"-Osmosis Regen","source_tag":"_t","target":"-渗透吸收"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e67f79e65a0c8d6576a3881e945bcea0cdd474d0a75ad9e0c61d9591d2178a9d","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"dd1d2442caa90382868b42dc766ab167da0e4ee152c4bfe627dccbc84ceb83a8","logical_entry_identity":"e3c006d4c69fa7b84c8ae9434b59ce64a4ac969e318c16f1c37caafddc6c7563","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"You made it to Eyal! You are not quite sure where, but it can not be worse than the Fearscape.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你成功回到了埃亚尔！你不太清楚你到了哪里，但这不可能比恶魔空间更糟。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b2f3a445b1cdb157b130bf6da8610d9c23e9986b9ffde3533db7ad65f5d89c9f","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"dd88c88efbd61ef27f7f4218c13438dbf77bfff50f8de62e8c95c8791eedd301","logical_entry_identity":"e1d1e8097873fef32275d518813cd0f19fdbe6096a49e67e90176f81157f2fff","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"brutality","source_tag":"talent type","target":"残暴"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e683f0b4b2670342771fb91dc6db41a4683863bbe9382791ebe244a4a73b190f","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"de010befadb30a314e41c3d011d9d48ac526781bba885795e92f3116e238270b","logical_entry_identity":"d91abcb0ded1712a899ef0407c7d85801a67a823fc4557ccb7052046ee030085","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Randomly (%d%% chance) hurls up to %d flame bolts dealing %0.2f fire damage to foes in sight when you hit in melee.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"当你近战攻击命中时，有 %d%% 几率释放至多 %d 个火球，造成 %0.2f 点火焰伤害。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e1402454c084bee8bb44d77a55d9d65983dfe35566552029c889c06b7f2ab0c4","component":"ashes-urhrok","entry_revision_identity":"de5854b6490f22ca119ce6a4f91a2233f264350f6c36731cdb8172e7e08c8f22","logical_entry_identity":"6201d04c0f29d20cb87315a8722e78614567267d77318fcf7602d66dd0f73cd6","normalized_path":"tome-ashes-urhrok.lua","source":"Clever and tough, the engineers and warriors of our kind, making armor for our forces and holding the front lines against the hordes of Eyal.  While the children of ruby study new magical spells for our arsenal, and the children of emerald study ways to make our own bodies deadlier, the children of onyx focus on making new constructs from scratch, lashing flesh, magic, and steel together into towering creations that strike fear into Eyal.  Those who fight on the front lines have been created to do so rather than born, churned out in a semi-mature state by factories with Forge-Giant-produced armor bolted onto their skin at \"birth.\"  Though they are mostly flesh, the warrior onyx known as Quasits are very much machines, made with bolstered muscles without losing the clever minds they come from.  As eager as they are brilliant, Quasits are well-disciplined and capable in combat, and their armor allows them to easily take blows that would devastate a Wretchling or Fire Imp.  Devotion will get us far on its own, but the Quasit shows how much more we can do when we have fervor and patience working hand-in-hand.","source_tag":"_t","target":"聪明而顽强，我们中的工程师与战士，为我们制造护甲，同时奋战在埃亚尔边界前线。红宝石的孩子们学习兵工厂新的魔法，绿翡翠的孩子们学习令身躯更加致命的技巧，而玛瑙色的孩子们专心学习新的构架体，将魔法、血肉和钢铁融为一体，在埃亚尔大陆制造恐惧。那些奋战在前线的，与其说是生出来，不如说是制造出来——在工厂里由半成熟态大量炮制，一“出生”就身着锻造巨人亲制的护甲。尽管仍是血肉之躯，玛瑙战士——或者说夸塞魔——有着钢铁般的纪律和强大的近战能力，同时他们的护甲能抵抗重击，即使那重击能轻易毁灭一只酸液树魔或者火魔婴。奉献让我们向前迈进，但夸塞魔展示出，当我们拥有热情和耐心携手并进时，我们将走得更远。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"05